&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;当社、三井住友建設㈱、三道工業㈱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(会社数　計３社)&lt;/p&gt;
